/T (Programme starts with subject-wise tests that are integrated with fortnightly current affairs, moves on to full-length revision tests, and closes with three mock tests \(General Studies in the morning, CSAT in the afternoon\). A parallel CSAT track builds aptitude topic by topic and then moves to full-length CSAT tests. Every test is built to UPSC standard and followed by a detailed analysis with an explanation PDF.)
/E (Programme starts with subject-wise tests that are integrated with fortnightly current affairs, moves on to full-length revision tests, and closes with three mock tests \(General Studies in the morning, CSAT in the afternoon\). A parallel CSAT track builds aptitude topic by topic and then moves to full-length CSAT tests. Every test is built to UPSC standard and followed by a detailed analysis with an explanation PDF.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [75]
>>
